<!-- -->DRAG</div></div></a></div></div><div class="swiper-pagination"></div></div></section><div class="styles_textBlock__oBDA1 styles_w50__4yjBG"><div class="styles_text__ImNdA">Cut the Rope is a puzzle game franchise built around a simple idea: cut the ropes, figure out the sequence, and get the candy to Om Nom.

Across the series, that core mechanic evolves with new interactions, characters, and level designs while keeping the gameplay quick, responsive, and easy to pick up.</div></div><section class="styles_section__eb_WG"><div class="styles_sectionHead__iUA_D"><h1 class="styles_sectionTitle__TQHBW">Explore the games</h1><div class="styles_tagList__uV1qT"><div class="styles_tag__GfBLe styles_tagActive__ev4_9">all</div><div class="styles_tag__GfBLe">Cut The Rope</div></div></div><div class="styles_featuredList__irjR0"><a href="/games/cut-the-rope"><div class="styles_featuredCard__Ril_l"><div class="styles_pictureContainer__JOYS6"><div class="styles_wrapper__aSdQr styles_picture__biBKA"><span class="styles_skeleton__H93SY" aria-hidden="true"></span><img alt="Cut the Rope" fetchPriority="high" loading="eager" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="styles_image__qX2D2 styles_cover__KTgRv styles_fadeIn__rX1Qv" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" sizes="100vw" srcSet="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww-cms.zeptolab.com%2Fuploads%2Fctr_400x280x2_430a03f5e2.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww-cms.zeptolab.com%2Fuploads%2Fctr_400x280x2_430a03f5e2.jpg&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww-cms.zeptolab.com%2Fuploads%2Fctr_400x280x2_430a03f5e2.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww-cms.zeptolab.com%2Fuploads%2Fctr_400x280x2_430a03f5e2.jpg&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww-cms.zeptolab.com%2Fuploads%2Fctr_400x280x2_430a03f5e2.jpg&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww-cms.zeptolab.com%2Fuploads%2Fctr_400x280x2_430a03f5e2.jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww-cms.zeptolab.com%2Fuploads%2Fctr_400x280x2_430a03f5e2.jpg&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww-cms.zeptolab.com%2Fuploads%2Fctr_400x280x2_430a03f5e2.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w" src="/_next/i