p;q=75"/></div></div><div class="styles_content__PaZzQ"><h4 class="styles_title__saZK2">Cut the Rope 3</h4><div class="styles_markdown__LMZqm styles_description__6_CeH"><p>Accept the challenge to explore uncharted lands with Om Nom and cute little Nibble Nom</p></div></div></div></a><a href="/games/cut-the-rope-daily"><div class="styles_featuredCard__Ril_l"><div class="styles_pictureContainer__JOYS6"><div class="styles_wrapper__aSdQr styles_picture__biBKA"><span class="styles_skeleton__H93SY" aria-hidden="true"></span><img alt="Cut the Rope Daily" fetchPriority="high" loading="eager" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="styles_image__qX2D2 styles_cover__KTgRv styles_fadeIn__rX1Qv" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" sizes="100vw" srcSet="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww-cms.zeptolab.com%2Fuploads%2Fctr_daily_400x280x2_4101829d91.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww-cms.zeptolab.com%2Fuploads%2Fctr_daily_400x280x2_4101829d91.jpg&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww-cms.zeptolab.com%2Fuploads%2Fctr_daily_400x280x2_4101829d91.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww-cms.zeptolab.com%2Fuploads%2Fctr_daily_400x280x2_4101829d91.jpg&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww-cms.zeptolab.com%2Fuploads%2Fctr_daily_400x280x2_4101829d91.jpg&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww-cms.zeptolab.com%2Fuploads%2Fctr_daily_400x280x2_4101829d91.jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww-cms.zeptolab.com%2Fuploads%2Fctr_daily_400x280x2_4101829d91.jpg&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww-cms.zeptolab.com%2Fuploads%2Fctr_daily_400x280x2_4101829d91.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w" src="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww-cms.zeptolab.com%2Fuploads%2Fctr_daily_400x280x2_4101829d91.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75"/></div></div><div class="styles_content__PaZzQ"><h4 class="s